[{"id":166805886,"discussion_id":"a5dfe46055a4b6c5fc0fe237d20c2a2b0684b608","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu), [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62) (2/2) | ✅ [*crystalhu*](https://gitcode.com/crystalhu), [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n hz36amy_00, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:32:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T15:00:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166805902,"discussion_id":"58b147fb8bf400bb81f776363559bee3025d0e83","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:03+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166805983,"discussion_id":"2af75c00833385f842eca8b25f052f1d7cd5aa7b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复FlashAttention反向传播算子在处理变长序列（TND布局）时，因循环中批次索引（bIdx）递增后未进行边界检查，导致在计算当前序列长度（curS）时可能访问`seqS`数组越界的问题。该缺陷存在潜在的内存访问风险，影响代码的健壮性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`FlashAttentionScoreGradPost`类的`NZVecClc`函数及其特化版本中，针对TND布局增加了边界检查逻辑。具体修改为：当`bIdx`小于批次总数`b`时，使用`seqS[bIdx] - seqS[bIdx - 1]`计算当前序列长度；否则，将`curS`设置为0。此修改有效防止了数组越界访问，确保了代码的安全性。","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:27+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166806004,"discussion_id":"1540b4efd434082874d1f49f88d398d92da1a17c","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T10:33:33+08:00","user":{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","object_id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166806215,"discussion_id":"41b7c00c3053b74e3214e370dffd51ac27196af9","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=756f36faa5ef4f28900c4ac39f4b3da8&projectName=CANN'>756f36faa5ef4f28900c4ac39f4b3da8</a></b>][<b><a href='https:/